00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:34.600
Jojo's Bizarre Adventure is an epic saga spanning generations,

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.440
but one of the reasons it's been able to survive for as long as it has

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:41.080
