00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:39.840
Jojo's isn't just the inspiration for much of anime pop culture in Japan

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:42.620
It itself is seeding international pop culture references

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:44.560
and influences to the bone.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:47.460
Every part adding something new and evolving with real world culture,

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:50.460
